INSERT INTO biochar_news (title, chunk_text, url, embedding, publish_date) VALUES ('UK Biochar Research Centre | Welcome to the UKBRC', 'eting net-zero goals. The report explores the installation of biochar production plants up to 2023 and anticipates developments in 2024, with a focus on carbon-preserving applications in various industries, including metallurgy.
Readers will find detailed categorizations of production volumes and future market projections, providing a comprehensive view of the sector’s dynamics.
Download the full report to unlock these insights and more:
European Biochar Market Report 2023/2024 .
20 March 2024
Zoom into Soil webinar and recording
The British Society of Soil Science (BSSS) convened a webinar on the subject of biochar last week. If you missed it, there is a recording on the BSSS YouTube channel
here . Saran and Hamish teamed up in a one-hour session.
23 January 2023
