INSERT INTO biochar_news (title, chunk_text, url, embedding, publish_date) VALUES ('Pyrolysis | Applications', ' like biofuels, biochar, and syngas. In the UK, businesses and companies involved in pyrolysis need to adhere to specific laws and regulations to ensure environmental protection and safety standards are met.
Category :
|
Sub Category :
Posted on
2024-10-05 22:25:23
One of the primary regulations that businesses must comply with when operating a pyrolysis facility in the UK is the Environmental Permitting Regulations (EPR). These regulations govern the environmental permitting system for waste management activities, including pyrolysis operations. To operate legally, businesses must obtain an environmental permit from the appropriate
