INSERT INTO biochar_news (title, chunk_text, url, embedding, publish_date) VALUES ('Carbon Offset Farming: 7 Powerful Soil Practices for 2026', ' way to new carbon farming
practices . Always assess
baseline conditions
before and after implementation—especially with degraded or previously conventionally managed lands.
“By 2026, adopting 7 soil practices can increase on-farm carbon storage by up to 30%.”
Co-Benefits of Carbon Offset Farmland: Beyond Carbon
The true value of
soil carbon farming
isn’t just the
carbon offset .
Co-benefits
often exceed even the climate advantages, including:
🌲
Improved soil structure & water-holding capacity —resilient to drought and extreme weather.
🦋
Biodiversity gains —from wildlife corridors to pollinator support in diversified landscapes.
⚠
