INSERT INTO biochar_news (title, chunk_text, url, embedding, publish_date) VALUES ('Carbon Offset Farming: 7 Powerful Soil Practices for 2026', 'ion, above what would happen in regular farming. Unlike conventional systems, it focuses on boosting soil carbon, biodiversity, and climate resilience, while providing participation in offset markets.
2. How do I measure the carbon stored in my soil?
Use a blend of
soil sampling
(field/lab tests),
remote sensing
(e.g., NDVI, soil moisture via Farmonaut platforms), and carbon modeling. Accurate
baseline measurement
and repeat assessments every 2–5 years are key for credible MRV and offset verification.
3. Which practices offer the highest return for carbon offset revenue?
Agroforestry integration
and
