4. What role does technology like Farmonaut play in carbon farming?
Satellite monitoring, AI advisory, blockchain-backed traceability, and digital MRV streamline the entire process—from field-level data acquisition to market-ready verification and risk management. This shortens time-to-revenue and lowers costs.
5. How can I get started with carbon offset farming today?
Start by
assessing your soil carbon baseline , select a portfolio of practices suited to your land and climate, and consider using digital tools (such as
