INSERT INTO biochar_news (title, chunk_text, url, embedding, publish_date) VALUES ('Carbon Offset Farming: 7 Powerful Soil Practices for 2026', '’s app ) for ongoing monitoring, data traceability, and connecting to local or international carbon markets.
6. Is carbon offset farming only for large-scale farms?
No. Technology, digital MRV, and group certification schemes are making it accessible for smallholders and family-run farms—enabling everyone to participate in and benefit from carbon markets.
7. How do I protect against risks, such as loss of stored carbon due to natural disasters?
Diversify your soil practices, maintain buffer pools at the landscape level, and ensure robust insurance/contingency arrangements. Digital MRV (like Farmonaut provides) offers rapid detection, baseline resets, and transparent reporting.
