INSERT INTO biochar_news (title, chunk_text, url, embedding, publish_date) VALUES ('Trend watch: Soil carbon MRV & incentives in 2026 — signals, win…', 'ogy fragmentation undermining market fungibility.
The proliferation of competing soil carbon MRV approaches and crediting methodologies risks creating a market where credits from different programs are not comparable or interchangeable. Buyers already discount credits from practice-based methodologies relative to outcome-based approaches, and the lack of harmonized standards across Verra, Gold Standard, and the American Carbon Registry adds transaction costs and confusion.
Permanence reversals from extreme weather events.
