INTERVIEW: Sentiment in Japan’s GX-ETS remains lukewarm as emitters await policy clarity, annual survey shows
Sentiment in Japan’s national emissions market remains lukewarm as emitters await clarity on policy details such as carryover rules, according to the CEO of the consultancy that conducted the annual market survey in cooperation with the Tokyo Stock Exchange.
