VOLUNTARY
VCM MONTHLY: Over 30 mln credits issued as 2026 on course for record demand
Monthly carbon credit issuances topped 30 million for the first time in July since last December, as retirements dipped slightly but stand over 5 mln higher than at this stage in 2025, analysis of registry data shows.
Standard body seeks feedback on REDD methodology requirements for nesting within jurisdictions
A standard body is seeking feedback on its updated avoided deforestation methodology for small holders of land that outlines the requirements for nesting within a jurisdiction.
