INSERT INTO biochar_news (title, chunk_text, url, embedding, publish_date) VALUES ('CP Daily Newsletter: Wednesday August 5, 2026', 'mer Colombian minister as next chief
A former Colombian government minister has been selected to lead the Global Environment Facility (GEF) beginning in October.
AVIATION/SHIPPING
Global carbon asset manager wins Rwanda nod for 1.8 mln CORSIA‑eligible credits
A global carbon asset manager said Rwanda has authorised up to 1.8 million carbon credits from the Verra‑certified Improved Cookstove Project, enabling international transfer under Article 6 and use as CORSIA‑eligible units.
INTERVIEW: CORSIA ‘significant investment opportunity’ for New Zealand
The international aviation offset scheme CORSIA is a potential driver for investment in New Zealand’s forestry sector, a developer told Carbon Pulse, but the government’s lack of knowledge or plans regarding the scheme is a major barrier.
