Changing IMO’s Net-Zero Framework for shipping would put emission goals out of reach -analysis
Changes to the IMO’s Net-Zero Framework for international shipping could jeopardise the commitment made by governments in 2023 to price the sector’s emissions, and weaken the push to decarbonise, a non-profit warned ahead of further talks on the proposal.
