INSERT INTO biochar_news (title, chunk_text, url, embedding, publish_date) VALUES ('Voluntary Carbon Market News: August 3-9, 2026', ' sustainability report released on July 28 . The company became the first North American cargo carrier to join the International Air Transport Association''s (IATA) CO2 Connect initiative, aimed at improving the accuracy of carbon footprint data for flights and shipments. Atlas reconfirmed a target to cut Scope 1 emissions by a fifth by 2035 from a 2021 baseline. The company, one of the world''s largest operators of cargo freighter aircraft with over 90 units, ordered 20 Airbus A350F freighters in early 2026, with options for 20 more, saying the aircraft is expected to cut fuel use and emissions by up to a fifth compared with current freighters. Deliveries are set to begin in 2029. Share Link copied! Tue 19:58
