INSERT INTO biochar_news (title, chunk_text, url, embedding, publish_date) VALUES ('Behind Veolia’s Next-Gen Carbon Capture System in Sheffield', 'ith The Guardian in 2023, he said it was a “fantasy” simply investing in CCS would give polluters a licence to operate in the future.  António Guterres , the Secretary-General of the United Nations, thinks much the same. “The problem is not simply fossil fuel emissions. It is fossil fuels, period,” he said in 2023. António Guterres, the UN Secretary-General. Credit: WEF This is something that Veolia understands well.
