INSERT INTO biochar_news (title, chunk_text, url, embedding, publish_date) VALUES ('Tracking the Next Wave of State Food Waste Policy in 2026', 'her”). We have now added three new categories:
Disposal surcharge fees : Bills that add or increase per-ton disposal fees to incentivize recycling, composting, and donation.
End-market development : Legislation requiring government entities to purchase compost or other products developed from organic waste. This category also captures bills that incentivize the use of these products and aim to develop robust markets for organic end products.
